                                                "sense_id": "d9246a55-c5f4-3a4f-b128-7c86cf399d4d",
                                                "text": "I have enjoyed taking to my writing bureau and writing about poverty, benefit reform and the coalition government in the manner of a shit Dickens, or Orwell, but with tits."
