                                                "text": "Look at that tit driving on the wrong side of the road!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58edf0b0-63e4-42da-9ee2-500088dc4259",
                                                "sense_id": "cfce22eb-1fbb-3b86-8286-6447c4de262b",
                                                "text": "I know a lot of tits, Guv'nor. But I don't know any quite as fucking stupid as these two."
                                            },
