                                                "sense_id": "cfce22eb-1fbb-3b86-8286-6447c4de262b",
                                                "text": "John Watson (to Sherlock Holmes): It's Lestrade. Says they're all coming over here right now. Queuing up to slap on the handcuffs, every single officer you ever made feel like a tit. Which is a lot of people."
