                                                "example_id": "8f95200a-e8a0-4eb8-a27d-1470199f39f0",
                                                "sense_id": "90399227-d154-3927-ab3f-e642e902b2a2",
                                                "text": "they would vpbraid me therewith calling me idle Drone; Titting and flouting at me, that I should offer to sit downe at boord with cleane hand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04956ea4-d033-3e86-9924-ca900e884bce",
                                        "entry_id": "e494f577-e3e9-3b5d-8716-60ca12e82cc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chickadee; a small passerine bird of the genus Parus or the family Paridae, common in the Northern Hemisphere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "223eae64-a1f2-377c-ad17-83898a28fb4f",
                                        "entry_id": "e494f577-e3e9-3b5d-8716-60ca12e82cc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various other small passerine birds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e112ff3-cfc6-349f-b8e0-910dcffea720",
                                        "entry_id": "e494f577-e3e9-3b5d-8716-60ca12e82cc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small horse; a nag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6d4cf12-77ab-448a-b616-830aaaca2278",
                                                "sense_id": "7e112ff3-cfc6-349f-b8e0-910dcffea720",
                                                "text": "[…] he was reſolved, for the time to come, to ride his tit with more ſobriety."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37b42dc8-a3d8-4773-bf8a-d61916a8a514",
                                                "sense_id": "7e112ff3-cfc6-349f-b8e0-910dcffea720",
                                                "text": "Bob trotted gently by the side of the carriage. “Not a bad looking tit,” said St. Leger, as they went along."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b748a773-ca08-4b66-a38b-a9c62ab921ef",
                                                "sense_id": "7e112ff3-cfc6-349f-b8e0-910dcffea720",
                                                "text": "Gossiping, and smoothing the horse's mane down with his hand, \"A nice little tit,\" said the man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58a1bbe1-38e2-4011-a337-7c31546304e5",
                                                "sense_id": "7e112ff3-cfc6-349f-b8e0-910dcffea720",
                                                "text": "I shall keep my eye open, and the first pretty little tit I see that I think will suit you, I shall make the guv'nor buy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd51a03a-b73d-3a55-8005-9412d10b8269",
                                        "entry_id": "e494f577-e3e9-3b5d-8716-60ca12e82cc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young girl, later especially a minx, hussy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5942bb72-3e73-4c56-b9b1-a2bb879e556f",
                                                "sense_id": "dd51a03a-b73d-3a55-8005-9412d10b8269",
                                                "text": "\"What sort of a feringee is this?\" said a lively little tit—\"eh?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "002ca3a7-02a9-4792-9e47-624554fdbc0e",
                                                "sense_id": "dd51a03a-b73d-3a55-8005-9412d10b8269",
                                                "text": "But I don't mind; she's a pretty little tit, and Dick has taught her to call me uncle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bc5712c-1bb5-45a0-9d20-6c0d1dc09e96",
                                                "sense_id": "dd51a03a-b73d-3a55-8005-9412d10b8269",
                                                "text": "What, I suppose, Mr. Loader, you will be for your old friend the black ey'd girl, from Rosemary Lane. Ha ha! Well, 'tis a merry little tit. A thousand pities she's such a reprobate!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                        "entry_id": "e494f577-e3e9-3b5d-8716-60ca12e82cc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A morsel; a bit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1bfae17-4d27-4f81-b0b4-be06e5da6e95",
                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "Now if you can shew so neat a foot, ( shewing her shoe ) —Parlez moi de ça : —I suppose I was not noble enough for this squire; he must have a bit a blood, a tit of quality — but I shall be a countess soon, and a mighty good sort of countess I shall make."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81803059-b417-43c8-98e8-f7670c973202",
                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "Being drunk , he remembers not a tit of life before the drink came well home. It is not that he sees the past mistily; he does not see at all. He lives then only in as much of the present as the word of his master for the time being[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "210264c8-9aa2-4129-a9de-e1d8b71841b2",
                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "Would we understand woman if we took her whole instead of tit by tit?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34198a52-13e2-423f-8cb8-1b406599b13c",
                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "The one farthest from the river was the largest and tallest; they decreased in size toward the river, until the fourth was little more than a tit of rock jutting up out of the prairie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
